          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " baby blanket is 75 x 90 cm. Raised popcorn clusters sit in a staggered grid against a plain treble background. The popcorn pops forward on the right side of the fabric."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton keeps the fabric soft and machine-washable. Popcorns use more yarn than bobbles because all five trebles are full height before joining. Total yardage is around 400 g."
          }
        ]
      },
